---
import { analyticTwoSiteGap, sshEdgeProfile, sshWinding } from '../../../data/part06/ch26TeachingModels.mjs';
const t1Initial = 0.55;
const t2Initial = 1.0;
const windingInitial = sshWinding(t1Initial, t2Initial);
const profileInitial = sshEdgeProfile(t1Initial, t2Initial, 12);
const gapInitial = analyticTwoSiteGap(t1Initial, t2Initial, 0);
const scale = 82;
const circleCx = 185 + scale * t1Initial;
const circleR = scale * Math.abs(t2Initial);
---

<figure class="chapter-visual winding-edge" data-winding-edge>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：复平面绕行与半无限链端态</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: complex-plane winding and a semi-infinite-chain end state</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls">
    <label><span>晶胞内跃迁 t₁ | intracell hopping</span><input type="range" min="0.15" max="1.35" step="0.01" value={t1Initial} data-we-t1 /><output data-we-t1-out>{t1Initial.toFixed(2)}</output></label>
    <label><span>晶胞间跃迁 t₂ | intercell hopping</span><input type="range" min="0.15" max="1.35" step="0.01" value={t2Initial} data-we-t2 /><output data-we-t2-out>{t2Initial.toFixed(2)}</output></label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 720 360" role="img" aria-labelledby="we-title we-desc">
    <title id="we-title">Winding circle and analytic SSH edge-state decay</title>
    <desc id="we-desc">The left panel shows q of k as a circle relative to the origin. The right panel shows alternating bonds and the normalized analytic left-edge amplitude.</desc>

    <g aria-label="complex plane">
      <line x1="40" y1="165" x2="385" y2="165" class="we-axis" />
      <line x1="185" y1="35" x2="185" y2="295" class="we-axis" />
      <text x="365" y="153">Re q</text><text x="195" y="47">Im q</text>
      <circle cx="185" cy="165" r="5" class="we-origin" />
      <circle cx={circleCx} cy="165" r={circleR} class="we-loop" data-we-loop />
      <line x1="185" y1="315" x2="267" y2="315" class="we-scale" />
      <text x="190" y="340">one model energy unit</text>
    </g>

    <g aria-label="finite-chain termination and edge profile">
      <text x="430" y="48">A₀—B₀   A₁—B₁   …</text>
      {Array.from({ length: 6 }, (_, index) => {
        const xA = 435 + index * 43;
        const xB = xA + 18;
        return (
          <g>
            <circle cx={xA} cy="92" r="5" class="we-site-a" />
            <circle cx={xB} cy="92" r="5" class="we-site-b" />
            <line x1={xA + 5} y1="92" x2={xB - 5} y2="92" class="we-bond we-bond-t1" data-we-bond-t1 />
            {index < 5 && <line x1={xB + 5} y1="92" x2={xA + 38} y2="92" class="we-bond we-bond-t2" data-we-bond-t2 />}
          </g>
        );
      })}
      <line x1="420" y1="112" x2="700" y2="112" class="we-divider" />
      <text x="430" y="138">normalized |Aₙ|</text>
      {profileInitial.amplitudes.map((value, index) => (
        <rect x={435 + index * 21} y={292 - 145 * Math.abs(value)} width="12" height={145 * Math.abs(value)} class="we-amplitude" data-we-amplitude={index} />
      ))}
      <line x1="428" y1="292" x2="700" y2="292" class="we-axis" />
      <text x="650" y="318">cell n</text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span data-we-gap>bulk gap = {gapInitial.toFixed(2)}</span>
    <span data-we-winding>winding = {windingInitial.winding}</span>
    <span data-we-xi>ξ/a = {profileInitial.localizationLength.toFixed(2)}</span>
    <strong data-we-status>Origin enclosed; a normalizable left-edge solution exists for the shown termination.</strong>
  </div>

  <noscript><p><strong>无 JavaScript 回退 | No-JavaScript fallback:</strong> t₁=0.55、t₂=1.00，复平面圆包围原点，bulk gap=0.90，左端解析振幅按 $(-t_1/t_2)^n$ 衰减。</p></noscript>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>$q(k)=t_1+t_2e^{ik}$，$\Delta=0$。本站 Bloch convention 下，圆包围原点时 winding 为 1。所示左端半无限链取 A 位点起始，零能解满足 $A_{n+1}=-(t_1/t_2)A_n$、$B_n=0$。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> $q(k)=t_1+t_2e^{ik}$ with $\Delta=0$. In the stated Bloch convention the winding is one when the circle encloses the origin. The displayed semi-infinite chain starts on an A site and its zero-energy solution obeys $A_{n+1}=-(t_1/t_2)A_n$, $B_n=0$.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>$|t_2|>|t_1|$ 时圆包围原点、解析解可归一化；$|t_2|=|t_1|$ 时 bulk gap 闭合且局域长度发散；$|t_2|<|t_1|$ 时同一终止下该左端解不可归一化。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> for $|t_2|>|t_1|$ the circle encloses the origin and the analytic solution is normalizable; at equality the bulk gap closes and the localization length diverges; for $|t_2|<|t_1|$ the same left-boundary solution is not normalizable.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>该结论依赖 chiral 对称和所示终止。有限链两端会杂化并产生指数小的能级分裂；加入子格势或同子格跃迁可移动端态能量。普通 Shockley 状态与受更强拓扑保护的边界谱必须分级讨论。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the statement assumes chiral symmetry and the shown termination. Two ends of a finite chain hybridize and acquire an exponentially small splitting; sublattice potentials or same-sublattice hopping may shift the end-state energy. Ordinary Shockley states and more strongly protected boundary spectral flow require separate evidence levels.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  import { analyticTwoSiteGap, sshEdgeProfile, sshWinding } from '../../../data/part06/ch26TeachingModels.mjs';
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-winding-edge]').forEach((root) => {
    const t1 = root.querySelector('[data-we-t1]');
    const t2 = root.querySelector('[data-we-t2]');
    if (!(t1 instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(t2 instanceof HTMLInputElement)) return;
    const setText = (selector, value) => {
      const element = root.querySelector(selector);
      if (element instanceof HTMLElement || element instanceof SVGTextElement) element.textContent = value;
    };
    const update = () => {
      const a = Number(t1.value);
      const b = Number(t2.value);
      const winding = sshWinding(a, b, 1e-9);
      const profile = sshEdgeProfile(a, b, 12);
      const gap = analyticTwoSiteGap(a, b, 0);
      const loop = root.querySelector('[data-we-loop]');
      if (loop instanceof SVGCircleElement) {
        loop.setAttribute('cx', (185 + 82 * a).toFixed(2));
        loop.setAttribute('r', (82 * Math.abs(b)).toFixed(2));
      }
      root.querySelectorAll('[data-we-amplitude]').forEach((bar) => {
        if (!(bar instanceof SVGRectElement)) return;
        const index = Number(bar.dataset.weAmplitude);
        const height = 145 * Math.abs(profile.amplitudes[index] ?? 0);
        bar.setAttribute('y', (292 - height).toFixed(2));
        bar.setAttribute('height', height.toFixed(2));
      });
      root.querySelectorAll('[data-we-bond-t1]').forEach((line) => { if (line instanceof SVGLineElement) line.style.strokeWidth = String(1.5 + 4 * a / 1.35); });
      root.querySelectorAll('[data-we-bond-t2]').forEach((line) => { if (line instanceof SVGLineElement) line.style.strokeWidth = String(1.5 + 4 * b / 1.35); });
      setText('[data-we-t1-out]', a.toFixed(2));
      setText('[data-we-t2-out]', b.toFixed(2));
      setText('[data-we-gap]', `bulk gap = ${gap.toFixed(2)}`);
      setText('[data-we-winding]', winding.gapClosed ? 'winding undefined at gap closing' : `winding = ${winding.winding}`);
      setText('[data-we-xi]', Number.isFinite(profile.localizationLength) ? `ξ/a = ${profile.localizationLength.toFixed(2)}` : 'ξ/a = ∞');
      const status = winding.gapClosed
        ? 'Bulk gap closed: the two insulating classes meet.'
        : profile.normalizable
          ? 'Origin enclosed; a normalizable left-edge solution exists for the shown termination.'
          : 'Origin not enclosed; the displayed left-edge ansatz grows into the bulk.';
      setText('[data-we-status]', status);
    };
    [t1, t2].forEach((input) => input.addEventListener('input', update));
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .winding-edge svg { width: 100%; max-height: 27rem; }
  .winding-edge text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 13px; }
  .we-axis, .we-divider, .we-scale { stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-4); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .we-origin { fill: var(--sl-color-red-high, #b42318); }
  .we-loop { fill: none; stroke: var(--sl-color-text-accent); stroke-width: 4; }
  .we-site-a { fill: var(--sl-color-accent-high); }
  .we-site-b { fill: var(--sl-color-text-accent); }
  .we-bond { stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3); }
  .we-amplitude { fill: var(--sl-color-text-accent); }
</style>
